# Agent Authority Policy

Spec: AuthorityPolicy
Purpose:
  Define authority levels for multi-agent coordination. Links risk
  levels to agent autonomy and graph modification permissions.

Owns: policies/authority.sdd

AuthorityLevels:
  L0: observe-only — AI reports findings, human decides all actions
  L1: human-approved actions — AI proposes, human approves each step
  L2: autonomous within approved plan — AI executes, human reviews per gate
  L3: autonomous with checkpoints — AI executes, human reviews at milestones
  L4: autonomous with notification — AI executes, human is informed
  L5: fully autonomous — AI executes, documents, and learns without human gate
  default: L2

RiskMapping:
  LOW:     autonomous
  MEDIUM:  autonomous + review
  HIGH:    approval required / strong verification
  CRITICAL: human approval required

  rule: risk level determines autonomy ceiling

GraphModification:
  LOW:     auto
  MEDIUM:  auto + log
  HIGH:    review
  CRITICAL: approval

  rule: AI may not modify graph without appropriate authority

State: +
